"子西","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001935","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001892","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"子西","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001935","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0078","start":78,"end":81,"surface":"太子珍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p046","text":"昭王元年，楚衆不説費無忌，以其讒亡太子建，殺伍奢子父與郤宛。宛之宗姓伯氏子及子胥皆奔呉，呉兵數侵楚，楚人怨無忌甚。楚令尹子常誅無忌以説衆，衆乃喜。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"費無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001929","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001931","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"郤宛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"宛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"伯氏子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001981","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001933","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001934","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p048","text":"十年冬，呉王闔閭、伍子胥、伯與唐、蔡倶伐楚，楚大敗，呉兵遂入郢，辱平王之墓，以伍子胥故也。呉兵之來，楚使子常以兵迎之，夾漢水陣。呉伐敗子常，子常亡奔鄭。楚兵走，呉乘勝逐之，五戰及郢。己卯，昭王出奔。庚辰，呉人入郢。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0004","start":4,"end":8,"surface":"呉王闔閭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001933","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"伯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"本版僅作伯，未補嚭字或直接連到他篇伯嚭；需核對版本與同一伐楚事件。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001892","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001933","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001934","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001934","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001934","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p049","text":"昭王亡也至雲夢。雲夢不知其王也，射傷王。王走鄖。鄖公之弟懷曰：「平王殺吾父，今我殺其子，不亦可乎？」鄖公止之，然恐其弒昭王，乃與王出奔隨。呉王聞昭王往，卽進撃隨，謂隨人曰：「周之子孫封於江漢之閒者，楚盡滅之。」欲殺昭王。王從臣子綦乃深匿王，自以爲王，謂隨人曰：「以我予呉。」隨人卜予呉，不吉，乃謝呉王曰：「昭王亡，不在隨。」呉請入自索之，隨不聽，呉亦罷去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"鄖公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001959","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"弟懷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001960","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001892","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"吾父","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"鄖公之弟懷所說被平王殺的父親，未補姓名或與他篇同名相接。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"鄖公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001959","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"呉王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0110","start":110,"end":111,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"子綦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001936","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0118","start":118,"end":119,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0123","start":123,"end":124,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001936","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0148","start":148,"end":150,"surface":"呉王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0153","start":153,"end":155,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p050","text":"昭王之出郢也，使申鮑胥請救於秦。秦以車五百乘救楚，楚亦收餘散兵，與秦撃呉。十一年六月，敗呉於稷。會呉王弟夫概見呉王兵傷敗，乃亡歸，自立爲王。闔閭聞之，引兵去楚，歸撃夫概。夫概敗，奔楚，楚封之堂谿，號爲堂谿氏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m050-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m050-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"申鮑胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001982","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m050-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"呉王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m050-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"夫概","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m050-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"呉王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m050-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"闔閭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m050-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"夫概","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m050-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"夫概","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001983","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p051","text":"楚昭王滅唐九月，歸入郢。十二年，呉復伐楚，取番。楚恐，去郢，北徙都鄀。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m051-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"楚昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p053","text":"二十七年春，呉伐陳，楚昭王救之，軍城父。十月，昭王病於軍中，有赤雲如鳥，夾日而蜚。昭王問周太史，太史曰：「是害於楚王，然可移於將相。」將相聞是言，乃請自以身禱於神。昭王曰：「將相，孤之股肱也，今移禍，庸去是身乎！」弗聽。卜而河爲祟，大夫請禱河。昭王曰：「自吾先王受封，望不過江、漢，而河非所獲罪也。」止不許。孔子在陳，聞是言，曰：「楚昭王通大道矣。其不失國，宜哉！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"楚昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0044","start":44,"end":47,"surface":"周太史","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002049","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"太史","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002049","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"將相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"周太史與楚昭王對話中的官員群體，不以子常、子西等已知人物補成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"將相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"周太史與楚昭王對話中的官員群體，不以子常、子西等已知人物補成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"將相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"周太史與楚昭王對話中的官員群體，不以子常、子西等已知人物補成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"請禱河的大夫未明是單人或群體，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0154","start":154,"end":156,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000056","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m053-0166","start":166,"end":169,"surface":"楚昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p054","text":"昭王病甚，乃召諸公子大夫曰：「孤不佞，再辱楚國之師，今乃得以天壽終，孤之幸也。」讓其弟公子申爲王，不可。又讓次弟公子結，亦不可。乃又讓次弟公子閭，五讓，乃後許爲王。將戰，庚寅，昭王卒於軍中。子閭曰：「王病甚，捨其子讓群臣，臣所以許王，以廣王意也。今君王卒，臣豈敢忘君王之意乎！」乃與子西、子綦謀，伏師閉涂，迎越女之子章立之，是爲惠王。然後罷兵歸，葬昭王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"公子申","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001937","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"此王為讓位／答應為王的提議用語，不是昭王的指代；未由提議作實際即位、授予或身份用稱。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"公子結","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001938","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"公子閭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001939","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0080","start":80,"end":81,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"此王為讓位／答應為王的提議用語，不是昭王的指代；未由提議作實際即位、授予或身份用稱。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"子閭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001939","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0100","start":100,"end":101,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0115","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0119","start":119,"end":120,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"君王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"君王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"子西","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001935","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"子綦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001936","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0154","start":154,"end":156,"surface":"越女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001961","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"子章","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001916","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001916","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0174","start":174,"end":176,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p097","text":"鬻熊之嗣，周封於楚。僻在荊蠻，蓽路藍縷。及通而霸，僭號曰武。文旣伐申，成亦赦許。子圉篡嫡，商臣殺父。天禍未悔，憑奸自怙。昭困奔亡，懷迫囚虜。頃襄、考烈，祚衰南土。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_suoyin_zan","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"鬻熊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001854","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m097-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"通","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001879","status":"contextua